     This[0m[2m solves[0m[2m both[0m[2m overs[0m[2melling and[0m[2m ghost charges[0m[2m. Plus[0m[2m with[0m[2m idempotent[0m[2m `[0m[2mcharge()`,[0m[2m no duplicate[0m[2m charges.[0m[2m
     
